{"version":1,"content":"<p>47歲廖碧兒（Bernice）盛傳與70歲富豪呂禮章蜜運中，Bernice早前在社交平台分享手挽男方合照，疑有意公開戀情，之後又分享數張蔚藍天空出現「I ♡ B」照片和曬出4卡鑽戒，暗示獲男友求婚，2人好事近。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:45.193542+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:43:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.093740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:09.066700+00:00","content_hash":"86996eb68c50e6256dc636fe5ecb953187981f4889e718638a62ef5973b61eab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}